<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Offer Letter</title>

  <style>
    /* A4 SIZE + PADDING */
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 20mm 20mm 20mm 20mm;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .company-name {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #000;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .company-tagline {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin: 15px 0;
      color: #000;
    }

    /* CONTENT STYLES */
    .content-section {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .clause-number {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: #000;
    }

    .clause-content {
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .signature-block {
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .signature-line {
      border-top: 1px solid #000;
      width: 200px;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .footer {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #555;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .page-break {
      page-break-before: always;
    }

    /* List styles */
    ul {
      margin: 5px 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .indent {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- PAGE 1 -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="company-name">Digi Tran</div>
    <div class="company-tagline">TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <div class="title">FIXED-TERM EMPLOYMENT OFFER LETTER</div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> <%= offer.offerDate || new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>To,</strong><br/>
      <strong><%= offer.name %>,</strong>
    </p>

    <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Offer of Engagement as a <%= offer.position %> (Renewable Fixed-Term Contract)</p>

    <p>
      Dear <strong><%= offer.name %></strong>,
    </p>

    <p>
      We are pleased to offer you an engagement as a <strong><%= offer.position %></strong> with the Client. 
      Your contractual engagement shall commence on <strong><%= offer.joiningDate %></strong> and will be valid 
      for a period of <strong>three (3) months</strong>, subject to renewal based on business requirements and your performance. 
      Please find below the terms and conditions governing this engagement:
    </p>

    <!-- CLAUSE 1 -->
    <div class="clause-number">1. Nature of Engagement</div>
    <div class="clause-content">
      You shall be engaged as a <strong><%= offer.position %></strong> on DigiTran's payroll to deliver services for the Client. 
      This engagement does not create an employer-employee relationship, and you shall not be entitled to any benefits 
      applicable to regular employees of the Company. This engagement will be completely remote based.
    </div>

    <!-- CLAUSE 2 -->
    <div class="clause-number">2. Contract Tenure</div>
    <div class="clause-content">
      The initial term of this agreement shall be three (3) months, renewable solely at DigiTran's discretion. 
      Renewal or termination shall depend on project requirements, performance evaluation, and client satisfaction.
    </div>

    <!-- CLAUSE 3 -->
    <div class="clause-number">3. Timesheet</div>
    <div class="clause-content">
      The timesheet approved by the client shall only be considered for the payroll processing.
    </div>

    <!-- CLAUSE 4 -->
    <div class="clause-number">4. Client's Right of Absorption (Performance-Based)</div>
    <div class="clause-content">
      The client reserves the right to absorb any deployed resource into their permanent rolls based on individual 
      performance, conduct, and organizational requirements. Such absorption shall be at the sole discretion of 
      the client and may occur after a minimum deployment period of three (3) months.
    </div>

    <!-- CLAUSE 5 -->
    <div class="clause-number">5. Induction and Training Duration</div>
    <div class="clause-content">
      You will undergo a training of 7-10 days.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER FOR PAGE 1 -->
  <div class="footer">
    HD-121 Wework, Embassy Tech Village | Bangalore<br/>
    Email : hr@digitran.agency Phone: 9632825286
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE BREAK -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <!-- PAGE 2 -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="company-name">Digi Tran</div>
    <div class="title" style="visibility: hidden;">FIXED-TERM EMPLOYMENT OFFER LETTER</div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 6 -->
  <div class="clause-number">6. Duties and Responsibilities</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    You shall perform services as assigned by DigiTran or its client with diligence, professionalism, and integrity. 
    Your working hours shall be as per the project's operational requirements (generally 6 days a week, 9 hours per day). 
    You agree to extend your working hours as necessary to meet delivery timelines or client expectations. 
    You may be required to work at DigiTran offices, client premises, or remotely, as directed.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 7 -->
  <div class="clause-number">7. Compensation</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    The annual compensation will be <strong>₹<%= offer.salary %> per annum</strong> (inclusive of all taxes and statutory deductions). 
    Payment will be released on 10th of the subsequent month, subject to satisfactory completion of deliverables. 
    You will not be eligible for bonuses, incentives, or other benefits unless specifically approved in writing by DigiTran.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 8 -->
  <div class="clause-number">8. Leave Policy</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    <ul>
      <li>You are entitled to 1 leave per month (non-encashable and non-carry forwardable beyond the contract term). Any absence beyond approved leave will result in proportionate deduction.</li>
      <li>Continuous absence without approved leave or prior notification for 1 week will be treated as voluntary abandonment of employment and may result in immediate termination of employment without further notice.</li>
      <li>You should send a prior mail to the HR for the approval of your leaves.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 9 -->
  <div class="clause-number">9. Expenses</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    Business-related expenses (travel, communication, etc.) shall be reimbursed only upon prior approval from DigiTran 
    and submission of valid proof as per company policy.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 10 -->
  <div class="clause-number">10. Termination</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    DigiTran may terminate this agreement at any time with or without cause by providing 15 days' notice or payment in lieu thereof.
    <ul>
      <li>You may resign by giving 15 working days' written notice, subject to DigiTran's acceptance. No compensation will be payable upon termination, non-renewal, or completion of contract term.</li>
      <li>The contract will be terminated if the client has issues with performance or actions in office without payment.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 11 -->
  <div class="clause-number">11. Confidentiality and IP Ownership</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    You shall maintain strict confidentiality of all proprietary, client, or project-related information both during and after your engagement. 
    All intellectual property, documents, and creative work produced during your engagement shall be the exclusive property of DigiTran. 
    Upon termination, you must return or permanently delete all materials belonging to DigiTran or its clients.
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER FOR PAGE 2 -->
  <div class="footer">
    HD-121 Wework, Embassy Tech Village | Bangalore<br/>
    Email : hr@digitran.agency Phone: 9632825286
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE BREAK -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <!-- PAGE 3 -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="company-name">Digi Tran</div>
    <div class="title" style="visibility: hidden;">FIXED-TERM EMPLOYMENT OFFER LETTER</div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 12 -->
  <div class="clause-number">12. Non-Compete & Non-Solicitation</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    You shall not, during or for 36 months after termination, engage with DigiTran's clients, prospects, or suppliers directly or indirectly without written approval. 
    You shall not solicit DigiTran's employees, clients, or partners for business or employment.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 13 -->
  <div class="clause-number">13. Liability & Indemnification</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    You agree to indemnify and hold DigiTran harmless against any claims, losses, or damages arising from negligence, 
    misconduct, or breach of confidentiality by you. DigiTran shall not be liable for any indirect, consequential, or special damages whatsoever.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 14 -->
  <div class="clause-number">14. Legal Compliance & Jurisdiction</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    This agreement shall be governed by the laws of India, with exclusive jurisdiction in the courts of Bengaluru, Karnataka. 
    Any dispute shall be referred to arbitration under the Arbitration & Conciliation Act, 1996, with a sole arbitrator appointed by DigiTran.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 15 -->
  <div class="clause-number">15. Communication Protocol</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    You shall discuss only Payroll or commercial related works with DigiTran and work/project related works with the client.
  </div>

  <!-- CLAUSE 16 -->
  <div class="clause-number">16. Entire Agreement</div>
  <div class="clause-content">
    This letter represents the complete understanding between you and DigiTran and supersedes any prior discussions or correspondence.
  </div>

  <!-- ACCEPTANCE SECTION -->
  <div class="signature-section">
    <div class="clause-content">
      <strong>Acceptance:</strong><br/>
      By signing this letter, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and voluntarily accepted the terms and conditions mentioned herein.
    </div>

    <div class="signature-block">
      <p><strong>For DigiTran</strong></p>
      
      <% if (offer.signature) { %>
        <img src="<%= offer.signature %>" style="width: 160px; margin: 8px 0;"/>
      <% } %>
      
      <p><strong>Name: Subrat Kumar Sen</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Designation: Co-Founder & Director</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Date: <%= offer.offerDate || new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-block">
      <p><strong>Accepted & Agreed by Candidate</strong></p>
      <p>Signature: ______________________</p>
      <p>Name: <%= offer.name %></p>
      <p>Date: __________________________</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER FOR PAGE 3 -->
  <div class="footer">
    HD-121 Wework, Embassy Tech Village | Bangalore<br/>
    Email : hr@digitran.agency Phone: 9632825286
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE BREAK -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <!-- PAGE 4 (EMPTY WITH ONLY FOOTER) -->
  <div style="height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: flex-end;">
    <div class="footer">
      HD-121 Wework, Embassy Tech Village | Bangalore<br/>
      Email : hr@digitran.agency Phone: 9632825286
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>